-- Reconcile the rep roster against the master spreadsheet (2026-07-24).
--
-- The seed (20260707000000) was built from an older export, so beyond the
-- missing street addresses a handful of fields had drifted — e.g. Jennifer
-- Calhoun moved Menasha -> Appleton, and Meg Brownson's email had a typo. This
-- refreshes every seeded rep to the current spreadsheet values.
--
-- Matched on (agency_code, name): the roster has no other stable key. Rows added
-- or renamed through the /sales-team form won't match and are left untouched, so
-- this never clobbers a UI-managed rep — it only re-syncs the seeded roster.
-- Idempotent: re-running writes the same values.

